---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About — ${SITE.author}`}
  description="Get to know indie author Madison Ilia—police dispatcher, licensed massage therapist, dog and horse mom, and writer of romantic suspense."
  activePage="about"
>
  <section class="page-hero section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">About the Author</span>
      <h1>Madison Ilia</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-parchment">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <aside class="about-sidebar">
        <img
          src="/images/madison-eyes.jpg"
          alt="Close-up portrait of author Madison Ilia"
          width="800"
          height="1422"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="about-portrait"
        />

        <blockquote class="author-quote">
          <p>
            “Strength and courage are not present with the absence of fear. Merely that people and
            situations are and will be more important than fear alone. Through our weakest link we
            are strong. By love we possess our greatest weapon.”
          </p>
          <footer>{'(}—{) Madison Ilia'}</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </aside>

      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="lead-para">
          I suppose a formal introduction is appropriate. I’m Madison Ilia. I live in a middle of
          nowhere town, where the sun shines once a week if we’re lucky, we have more rocks than
          grass, and the trees have taken over; but it’s ok—we hold our own when we need to cut it.
        </p>

        <p>
          I talk too much, type even faster, laugh when I shouldn’t, drink too much coffee or{' '}
          <a href="https://wearerasa.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rasa</a>, and I’m
          allergic to red food coloring. The reaction is… more talking, faster walking, an overload
          of writing, and an unattainable amount of energy. If energy were sellable, I wouldn’t need
          my current day/night/overnight job (a little rotating shift humor).
        </p>

        <p>
          I love Jesus and strive to be the best version of myself every day; some days are better
          than others.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m the mother of a wonderful daughter. I’m also a dog mom, a horse mom, a sister, a
          daughter, an energetic individual, and a writer that has many words with a shortage of
          hours in a day to write them all down. I’m a police dispatcher most days, a sane person
          every once in a while, a licensed massage therapist when it suits me, and lastly, a book
          nerd. What writer do you know that doesn’t equally enjoy reading? One might say I have a
          lot of interests that are scattered all over the place; can’t say I would correct them. I
          like to embrace life and experience as much of this beautiful world God created for us as
          I can!
        </p>

        <p>
          See, that wasn’t half bad. Subscribe to my newsletter to get exclusive content and release
          dates only available to subscribers! I’m on Facebook and Instagram and check my email
          daily! Reach out if you feel so compelled—I would love to hear from you! Stay blessed!
        </p>

        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="/novels.html" class="btn btn-primary">Explore My Novels</a>
          <a href="/subscribe.html" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Join the Newsletter</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4rem) 2.25rem;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 380px) 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-portrait {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
  }

  .author-quote {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-night);
    color: var(--text-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .author-quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .author-quote footer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .about-copy p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .lead-para {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-copy a {
    color: #8c5a2b;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-sidebar {
      max-width: 400px;
    }
  }
</style>
